{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Family Vault 是一款以家庭為核心的私密行程與活動管理 App，適合需要統籌聚會、生日、婚禮及家庭投票的使用者；原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-131.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>拍照邀請自動建立行程</h2>\n<p>Family Vault 集中整理家庭聚會、生日與婚禮等重要日子，並可透過家庭投票快速決定日期、時間或餐廳。收到紙本邀請卡時，只需用相機拍攝，App 便會自動建立活動，甚至保留卡上的登記連結與回覆頁面。內容只在受邀家人之間同步，沒有公開動態或陌生人搜尋，讓每項安排保持私密、清晰且不易遺漏。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-587-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-588-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-589-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-590-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Family Vault: Shared Calendar</li><li>應用類別：Lifestyle</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/family-vault-shared-calendar/id6503258884?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T01:01:42.369161+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":305,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T00:51:36+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T06:18:46.810217+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T00:59:01.244749+00:00","content_hash":"81290d5df5b89959913f46e6153c01a4157199e88c45d43a3ced15e75dc58aba","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}